WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.124
A compound sentence joins complete clauses while maintaining understandable subjects

00:00:05.124 --> 00:00:06.109
and predicates.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.834
Which contains two independent clauses joined by and? Answer: Esi watered the plants,

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:13.713
and Kofi swept the floor.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:18.800
Divide a compound sentence into its two clauses and rewrite it clearly.

00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:22.219
Both parts can stand alone as sentences.
